WEBVTT

00:00:00.224 --> 00:00:05.881
Managing hostels and rooms

00:00:05.931 --> 00:00:09.770
Open Hostel and Rooms, then press Add Hostel.

00:00:19.897 --> 00:00:26.250
Enter the hostel name, choose Boys, Girls or Mixed, and set the capacity and a warden.

00:00:31.700 --> 00:00:36.074
Press Add Hostel. The hostel appears in the list.

00:00:38.829 --> 00:00:41.758
Open the Rooms tab and choose the hostel.

00:00:47.803 --> 00:00:54.802
Press Add Room. Enter the room number, the floor and the capacity, and choose the room type.

00:01:01.447 --> 00:01:07.061
Press Add Room. The room shows its capacity and how many beds are taken.

00:01:10.958 --> 00:01:15.912
Hostel ready
